"stepperHidden":false,"productId":"777","features":{"title":"Key Features","items":[{"h":"Model: GPONLT-3608-2TE-2AC-B","c":[]},{"h":"Port: 8 GPON PON Ports","c":[]},{"h":"4 × Gigabit RJ45 Uplink Ports","c":[]},{"h":"2 × Gigabit SFP Uplink Ports","c":[]},{"h":"2 × 10G SFP+ Uplink Ports","c":[]},{"h":"Dual AC Redundant Power Supplies","c":[]},{"h":"GPON Downstream Speed: Up to 2.488 Gbps per PON Port","c":[]},{"h":"GPON Upstream Speed: Up to 1.244 Gbps per PON Port","c":[]},{"h":"Supports up to 1:128 Optical Split Ratio","c":[]},{"h":"Standard 1U 19-inch Rack Mount Design","c":[]},{"h":"Warranty: 01 Year","c":[]}],"noExpand":false},"tabs":[{"title":"Description","active":true,"cls":"tab-2","noExpand":false,"kind":"description","html":"\n                <p>The Digital Media GPONLT-3608-2TE-2AC-B 8-Port GPON OLT is a high-performance carrier-grade Optical Line Terminal (OLT) designed for FTTH (Fiber to the Home), FTTB (Fiber to the Building), FTTO, and enterprise fiber access networks. It is an ideal solution for Internet Service Providers (ISPs), telecom operators, and organizations requiring reliable, scalable, and high-capacity GPON deployment.</p><p><br></p><p>Equipped with 8 GPON PON ports, 4 Gigabit RJ45 uplink ports, 2 Gigabit SFP uplink ports, and 2 × 10G SFP+ uplink ports, the GPONLT-3608-2TE-2AC-B provides outstanding bandwidth capacity and flexible network expansion. The device also features dual AC redundant power supplies, ensuring uninterrupted operation and enhanced network reliability.</p><p><br></p><p>Supporting GPON downstream speeds of 2.488 Gbps and upstream speeds of 1.244 Gbps per PON port, this OLT offers efficient optical transmission and supports advanced Layer 2 networking functions, including VLAN, QoS, ACL, IGMP Snooping, DHCP Relay, and OMCI-based ONU management for simplified deployment and maintenance.</p><p><br></p><h3>Key Features</h3><p><br></p><ul><li>8 GPON PON Ports</li><li>4 × Gigabit RJ45 Uplink Ports</li><li>2 × Gigabit SFP Uplink Ports</li><li>2 × 10G SFP+ Uplink Ports</li><li>Dual AC Redundant Power Supplies</li><li>GPON Downstream Speed: Up to 2.488 Gbps per PON Port</li><li>GPON Upstream Speed: Up to 1.244 Gbps per PON Port</li><li>Supports up to 1:128 Optical Split Ratio</li><li>OMCI-based ONU Auto Discovery and Remote Management</li><li>VLAN, QoS, ACL, DHCP Relay, and IGMP Snooping Support</li><li>Web GUI, CLI, SNMP, Telnet, and EMS Management</li><li>Standard 1U 19-inch Rack Mount Design</li><li>Carrier-Grade Stability and High Reliability</li></ul>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"VSOL V1600G1-B 8 Port GPON OLT","href":"/vsol-v1600g1-b-8-port-gpon-olt","now":"125,000৳","old":"128,000৳","single":""},{"name":"VSOL V1600GS-F Single PON GPON OLT","href":"/vsol-v1600gs-f-single-pon-gpon-olt","now":"33,000৳","old":"35,000৳","single":""},{"name":"VSOL V1600GT 2-Port GPON OLT","href":"/vsol-v1600gt-2-port-gpon-olt","now":"54,000৳","old":"57,000৳","single":""},{"name":"VSOL V1600G2-B 16-Port GPON OLT","href":"/vsol-v1600g2-b-16-port-gpon-olt","now":"226,000৳","old":"230,000৳","single":""},{"name":"VSOL V1600G0-B 4-Port GPON OLT","href":"/vsol-v1600g0-b-4-port-gpon-olt","now":"87,000৳","old":"89,000৳","single":""},{"name":"ECOM Scalable 8 port with 4 PON port E08GPS-2S+ GPON OLT","href":"/ecom-scalable-8-port-with-4-pon-port-e08gps-2s-gpon-olt","now":"68,000৳","old":"71,300৳","single":""},{"name":"HSGQ-G08L 8-Port GPON OLT","href":"/hsgq-g08l-8-port-gpon-olt","now":"105,000৳","old":"108,000৳","single":""},{"name":"HSGQ-G04L 4-Port GPON OLT","href":"/hsgq-g04l-4-port-gpon-olt","now":"71,000৳","old":"73,000৳","single":""},{"name":"ECOM E01GP-S+ 1-PON Port GPON OLT","href":"/ecom-e01gp-s-1-pon-port-gpon-olt","now":"","old":"","single":"28,000৳"},{"name":"KingType GPT-C224V 4-Port GPON OLT","href":"/kingtype-gpt-c224v-4-port-gpon-olt","now":"","old":"","single":"0৳"